00:13:52,000 --> 00:13:58,000
Pound of Flesh is a action film directed by Ernie Barbarash.

3
00:20:48,000 --> 00:20:54,000
In China to donate his kidney to his dying niece, former black-ops agent Deacon awakes the
day before the operation to find he is the latest victim of organ theft.

4
00:27:44,000 --> 00:27:50,000
Stitched up and pissed-off, Deacon descends from his opulent hotel in search of his stolen
kidney and carves a blood-soaked path through the darkest corners of the city.

5
00:34:40,000 --> 00:34:46,000
The clock is ticking for his niece and with each step he loses blood.

